// The `core/compression` conformance package.
//
// Every stream here was written by zlib rather than by this implementation, so
// what the cases assert is agreement with the format and not agreement with
// yesterday's answer. Between them they cover the three block types RFC 1951
// has — stored, fixed and dynamic — a stream of more than one block, and the
// gzip member RFC 1952 wraps one in, with and without a file name.
